> li'u mintu lu lo glibau cu brito lo bangu li'u .e zoi gy. English is the
> language of the U.K. .gy}.
>
> Personally, I would much rather remember 6 words that can be used for /any/
> cultural reference, than a huge slew of words that can each only be used for
> one.
